From 73d74cc61d5ad20499d31ecb90d444015a93523e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YamadaBlog <mao@localhost>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:49:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add gaps.fullHeightWhenMenuBarHidden option

When macOS auto-hides the menu bar, measure the top outer gap from the
physical top edge instead of the visible frame, so notched displays can
use the camera band. Opt-in, default false; existing settings decode
unchanged. Includes layout and settings tests and reference docs.
